{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "local-lms-collection-001",
		"name": "LMS Mentoring API - Local",
		"description": "Postman collection for Learning Management System (Mentoring Project) - Local Development\n\n## Authentication\n\nThis collection is configured for **local development** with Basic Authentication.\n\n### Available Users\n\n| Username | Password | Roles | Access |\n|----------|----------|-------|--------|\n| user | password | USER | API endpoints |\n| manager | secret | USER, MANAGER | API + Actuator endpoints |\n\n### Environment Variables for Auth\n- `basic_username` / `basic_password` - Standard user credentials\n- `manager_username` / `manager_password` - Manager credentials\n\n### Public Endpoints (No Auth Required)\n- GET /actuator/health\n- GET /actuator/info\n- GET /swagger-ui/**\n- GET /v3/api-docs/**\n- GET /h2-console/**\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nUse with `local` environment:\n- `host`: http://localhost:8080\n- `studentId`: Sample student UUID\n- `courseId`: Sample course UUID",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
